    >>> x = jnp.array([[[0]], [[1]], [[2]]])
    >>> x.shape
    (3, 1, 1)

    Squeeze all length-1 dimensions:

    >>> jnp.squeeze(x)
    Array([0, 1, 2], dtype=int32)
    >>> _.shape
    (3,)

    Equivalent while specifying the axes explicitly:

    >>> jnp.squeeze(x, axis=(1, 2))
